---
import type { CrossborderFeatureGroups, CrossborderStatGroups } from './crossborder-content'

interface Props {
  features: CrossborderFeatureGroups
  stats: CrossborderStatGroups
}

const { features, stats } = Astro.props
---

<section
  class="crossborder-return crossborder-section"
  aria-labelledby="crossborder-return-heading"
>
  <div class="redesign-shell">
    <div>
      <p class="redesign-kicker">退回国内仓后</p>
      <h2 id="crossborder-return-heading">从到达国内仓开始处理</h2>
      <p>拆包入库后核对订单与 SKU 并录入 WMS，再按项目完成质检分级、处置和后续上架。</p>
      {
        features.returns.map(({ title, desc }) => (
          <p data-redesign-feature>
            <>
              <b data-feature-title>{title}</b>
              <span data-feature-description>{desc}</span>
            </>
          </p>
        ))
      }
      {
        stats.warehouse.map(({ stat, label, sub }) => (
          <p class="crossborder-stat">
            <>
              <b>{stat}</b>
              <span>
                {label} · {sub}
              </span>
            </>
          </p>
        ))
      }
      <p>
        <strong>仓内时效：</strong>质检与二次处理仅适用于国内仓内流程；跨境运输、报关和清关不计入。
      </p>
    </div>
    <aside>
      <p class="redesign-kicker">Urbanic 公开案例</p>
      <strong>千万件级处理规模</strong>
      <p>案例覆盖仓储、质检、包装、上架、库存管理及发货打包；统计口径以案例资料为准。</p>
      {
        stats.caseStudy.map(({ stat, label, sub }) => (
          <p class="crossborder-stat">
            <>
              <b>{stat}</b>
              <span>
                {label} · {sub}
              </span>
            </>
          </p>
        ))
      }
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
